# metabolomics source lives in its own repo at ~/PROJECTS/metabolomics-dashboard
# (remote: wagner-austin/metabolomics-dashboard). Only the built page is tracked
# here, because it IS the deploy artifact for austinwagner.org/metabolomics/.
# Must be `metabolomics/*` not `metabolomics/` — git cannot re-include a file
# whose parent directory is excluded, so the negation below needs the directory
# entry left unexcluded. Regression this guards: 2026-06-14..2026-07-30, when
# untracking the folder silently 404'd the published page.
metabolomics/*
!metabolomics/index.html
